    "body": "@lockwo, thanks for the feature request. I agree that having the choice of using more advanced QAOA mixers would be great. For this reason, we have been working on generalizing the ansatz layer of OQ for use with mixers other than `x` and `xy`. This feature is under review, and hopefully should be available soon!",
